sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Service as Any Service (Auth, Order, etc.)
    participant Logger as Python Logger ("audit")
    participant Handler as CeleryAuditLogHandler
    participant Broker as Celery Broker
    participant Worker as Celery Worker
    participant DB as Audit DB

    %% 1. Synchronous Application Execution
    User->>Service: Request Action (e.g. POST /users/register)
    activate Service
    Service->>Service: Execute business logic & update DB

    %% 2. Logger Trigger & Queue Dispatch
    Service->>Logger: logger.info("Event", extra={"audit": payload})
    activate Logger
    Logger->>Handler: emit(record)
    activate Handler
    Handler->>Broker: write_audit_log_task.delay(payload)
    activate Broker
    Broker-->>Handler: Task Queued ACK
    deactivate Broker
    deactivate Handler
    deactivate Logger

    %% 3. Immediate HTTP Response
    Service-->>User: Return 200 OK / 201 Created
    deactivate Service

    %% 4. Asynchronous Background Ingestion
    Note over Broker,Worker: Asynchronous Process (Worker Execution)
    Worker->>Broker: Poll / pull queued task
    activate Worker
    Worker->>DB: Batch store in DB
    activate DB
    DB-->>Worker: Commit OK
    deactivate DB
    deactivate Worker

